@startuml
title Encrypted backup and restore (BAK-001..004)
actor Doctor
participant "Backup job" as JOB
participant "hc-storage" as ST
database "clinic.db\nuser_content.db" as DB
participant "files/" as F
participant "Target\n(backups/ or USB)" as T
== Automatic daily backup (on first launch of day / app close) ==
JOB -> ST : run_backup(target, rotation)
ST -> DB : SQLite online backup API -> snapshot (app keeps working)
ST -> ST : backup key = Argon2id(backup password, salt)
ST -> ST : stream tar(snapshots + files) -> AES-256-GCM 1 MB chunks
F -> ST : encrypted blobs (re-wrapped)
ST -> T : write .hcbak.tmp, fsync, rename
ST -> T : verify: read header, decrypt test, checksum
ST -> ST : rotate 14 daily / 8 weekly / 12 monthly
ST --> JOB : ok + record last_backup_at
== Restore ==
Doctor -> ST : choose file + password
ST -> T : read header only
ST --> Doctor : preview (patients, last visit date)
Doctor -> ST : confirm
ST -> DB : safety backup of current data
ST -> T : decrypt + verify all chunks to temp dir
ST -> DB : swap files atomically, reopen, run migrations if older version
ST --> Doctor : restored, rebuild search index (PSR-013)
@enduml
